WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.012
Last week, measured from May

00:00:02.012 --> 00:00:03.880
eleventh to seventeenth in

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:05.748
Taipei time, the world was

00:00:05.748 --> 00:00:07.548
not defined by one event.

00:00:07.548 --> 00:00:09.348
Two forces moved at once:

00:00:09.348 --> 00:00:11.718
major powers tried to renegotiate

00:00:11.718 --> 00:00:13.586
order, while war risk kept

00:00:13.586 --> 00:00:14.800
spilling outward.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.600
Start in Beijing.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.400
Donald Trump visited China

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.532
from May thirteenth to fifteenth.

00:00:20.532 --> 00:00:22.332
After the talks, both sides

00:00:22.332 --> 00:00:24.723
emphasized trade repair, agricultural

00:00:24.723 --> 00:00:26.597
purchases, and market access.

00:00:26.597 --> 00:00:28.470
English-language reports said

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:30.270
China committed to buying

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:32.070
at least seventeen billion

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:33.870
dollars in US farm products

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:35.873
annually from twenty twenty-six

00:00:35.873 --> 00:00:37.747
to twenty twenty-eight, while

00:00:37.747 --> 00:00:38.900
moving on access for beef

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:38.900
and poultry.

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:40.809
But this was not just a trade

00:00:40.809 --> 00:00:42.609
story.

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:44.409
Taiwan was pulled into the

00:00:44.409 --> 00:00:46.209
same diplomatic frame.

00:00:46.209 --> 00:00:48.315
Reuters reported that Xi Jinping

00:00:48.315 --> 00:00:50.224
warned Trump that mishandling

00:00:50.224 --> 00:00:52.331
Taiwan could lead to a dangerous

00:00:52.331 --> 00:00:54.131
place.

00:00:54.131 --> 00:00:56.237
On May seventeenth, Lai Ching-te

00:00:56.237 --> 00:00:58.037
answered that Taiwan would

00:00:58.037 --> 00:00:59.837
not be sacrificed, traded

00:00:59.837 --> 00:01:01.637
away, or forced to accept

00:01:01.637 --> 00:01:03.437
an arrangement.In the same

00:01:03.437 --> 00:01:05.237
week, China said it would

00:01:05.237 --> 00:01:07.037
not allow Taiwan to attend

00:01:07.037 --> 00:01:08.837
the World Health Assembly,

00:01:08.837 --> 00:01:10.812
while Taiwan prepared meetings

00:01:10.812 --> 00:01:12.612
outside the formal session.

00:01:12.612 --> 00:01:14.412
In other words, Taiwan was

00:01:14.412 --> 00:01:16.212
not a side issue.

00:01:16.212 --> 00:01:18.000
It was where great-power bargaining,

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:18.000
international organizations,

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:18.000
and regional security overlapped.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.800
The second major line was

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:21.600
the Middle East.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:23.400
On May seventeenth, a drone

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.200
incident near the Barakah

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.1000
nuclear power plant in the

00:01:26.1000 --> 00:01:28.800
United Arab Emirates caused

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:30.637
a fire, while officials said

00:01:30.637 --> 00:01:32.475
there were no casualties and

00:01:32.475 --> 00:01:34.275
no radiation leak.

00:01:34.275 --> 00:01:36.075
Saudi Arabia also reported

00:01:36.075 --> 00:01:37.912
drone interceptions the same

00:01:37.912 --> 00:01:39.712
day.

00:01:39.712 --> 00:01:41.615
Markets reacted quickly, with

00:01:41.615 --> 00:01:43.518
oil rising to a two-week high

00:01:43.518 --> 00:01:45.355
as traders worried about the

00:01:45.355 --> 00:01:47.155
Strait of Hormuz and Gulf

00:01:47.155 --> 00:01:48.955
energy routes.The key point

00:01:48.955 --> 00:01:50.924
was not only whether the plant

00:01:50.924 --> 00:01:52.724
was damaged.

00:01:52.724 --> 00:01:54.524
It was that drones, energy

00:01:54.524 --> 00:01:56.690
corridors, nuclear-site security,

00:01:56.690 --> 00:01:58.490
and oil-price expectations

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:00.290
were now tied together.

00:02:00.290 --> 00:02:01.900
A regional war can move fast

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:01.900
into global energy markets,

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:01.900
shipping insurance, and supply-chain

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:01.900
pricing.

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:04.067
The third line was the continuing

00:02:04.067 --> 00:02:05.867
drone-ization of war.

00:02:05.867 --> 00:02:07.706
Russia said it had destroyed

00:02:07.706 --> 00:02:09.506
large numbers of Ukrainian

00:02:09.506 --> 00:02:11.306
drones over the week, while

00:02:11.306 --> 00:02:13.342
Moscow faced one of its largest

00:02:13.342 --> 00:02:15.181
attacks in more than a year.

00:02:15.181 --> 00:02:16.981
Ukraine, meanwhile, was hit

00:02:16.981 --> 00:02:18.819
by large-scale Russian drone

00:02:18.819 --> 00:02:20.724
and missile attacks.The trend

00:02:20.724 --> 00:02:22.628
is clear: war no longer stays

00:02:22.628 --> 00:02:24.428
at the front.

00:02:24.428 --> 00:02:26.727
Rear cities, energy infrastructure,

00:02:26.727 --> 00:02:28.960
transport nodes, and psychological

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:30.760
security are all becoming

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:32.560
targets.

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:34.360
Drones lower the threshold

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:36.160
for long-range strikes and

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:37.100
make the battlefield wider,

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:37.100
more routine, and harder

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:37.100
to contain.

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:39.450
The fourth line was the real-world

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:41.250
cost behind the AI boom.

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:43.050
Samsung Electronics faced

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:44.850
strike risk over bonuses,

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:46.923
pay, and profit sharing during

00:02:46.923 --> 00:02:48.723
a surge in AI-chip demand.

00:02:48.723 --> 00:02:50.935
South Korea's government stepped

00:02:50.935 --> 00:02:52.735
in because Samsung is not

00:02:52.735 --> 00:02:54.535
just one company.

00:02:54.535 --> 00:02:56.470
It is a major node in Korean

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:58.270
exports and in the global

00:02:58.270 --> 00:03:00.136
semiconductor supply chain.

00:03:00.136 --> 00:03:02.071
AI is not only a story about

00:03:02.071 --> 00:03:03.871
model launches.

00:03:03.871 --> 00:03:06.290
It is also a story about factories,

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.090
unions, and who captures

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:10.025
the profits when chip demand

00:03:10.025 --> 00:03:11.825
rises.

00:03:11.825 --> 00:03:14.036
Workers, companies, governments,

00:03:14.036 --> 00:03:16.455
and customers are all renegotiating

00:03:16.455 --> 00:03:16.700
who gets the gains and who

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:16.700
carries disruption risk.

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:18.500
Finally, public health and

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:20.409
climate reminded us that risk

00:03:20.409 --> 00:03:22.209
did not pause.

00:03:22.209 --> 00:03:24.249
WHO declared the Ebola outbreak

00:03:24.249 --> 00:03:26.049
in the Democratic Republic

00:03:26.049 --> 00:03:27.849
of the Congo and Uganda a

00:03:27.849 --> 00:03:29.649
public health emergency of

00:03:29.649 --> 00:03:31.449
international concern.

00:03:31.449 --> 00:03:33.686
In the same week, Andes hantavirus

00:03:33.686 --> 00:03:35.529
infections linked to a South

00:03:35.529 --> 00:03:37.503
America cruise drew attention,

00:03:37.503 --> 00:03:39.346
while severe storms in Uttar

00:03:39.346 --> 00:03:39.800
Pradesh caused heavy casualties.

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:41.743
So the week can be summarized

00:03:41.743 --> 00:03:44.021
this way: Beijing was negotiating,

00:03:44.021 --> 00:03:45.821
Taiwan was under pressure,

00:03:45.821 --> 00:03:47.630
the Gulf was still burning,

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:49.430
Ukraine's war was becoming

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:51.230
more drone-driven, and the

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:53.441
AI supply chain was renegotiating

00:03:53.441 --> 00:03:55.241
profit distribution.

00:03:55.241 --> 00:03:57.041
These looked like separate

00:03:57.041 --> 00:03:58.841
stories.

00:03:58.841 --> 00:04:00.650
Underneath, they pointed to

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:02.593
one problem: the global order

00:04:02.593 --> 00:04:04.603
is trying to regain stability,

00:04:04.603 --> 00:04:06.403
while risk spreads at the

00:04:06.403 --> 00:04:08.413
same time through war, energy,

00:04:08.413 --> 00:04:10.422
technology, and public health.

00:04:10.422 --> 00:04:12.222
This is Codex Guanlan.

00:04:12.222 --> 00:04:13.500
We'll keep reading the world

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:13.500
across the lines next week.
